cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CalibAudit"
abstract: "Calibration audit for probabilistic forecasts — Murphy decomposition of the Brier score with the reliability-resolution-uncertainty identity property-tested to machine precision, reliability diagrams with bootstrap bands, skill scores against a stated reference, and the binning bias of expected calibration error measured on synthetic forecasts of known calibration rather than merely noted; Platt and isotonic recalibration against the raw forecast as baseline, including the small-sample case where recalibration makes the score worse."
